  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Police reform Ukraine 2025-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Polisreform i Ukraina 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation between the Ukrainian and the Swedish Police Agencies for Police Reform in Ukraine linked to the EU accession process. The project focuses on organised crime and strategic planning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbete mellan ukrainska och svenska polismyndigheter f&#xF6;r polisreform i Ukraina kopplat till EU-processer med fokus p&#xE5; organiserad brottslighet och strategisk planering.</narrative>
  </description>
